    title: "Wedding Pagri Tying Service in Delhi",
    category: "Pagri tying service",
    serviceSlug: "wedding-safa-tying",
    intro: "Wedding Pagri Tying Service in Delhi covers exactly what we do best — professional, on-location safa and pagdi tying for weddings, baraats and every function in between.",
