    intro: "Groom Pagdi Rental and Tying in Delhi is a service we plan around your actual event, not a generic slot — the groom, family and baraat are each treated as their own batch.",
    section1Title: "What this covers",
    section1Body: "The service is quoted after we know the fabric, quantity, fold complexity and travel distance — sharing your date and venue upfront is the fastest way to get an accurate answer.",
    section2Title: "How to book",
    section2Body: "If your wedding spans more than one function — haldi, sangeet, reception — mention every date together so we can quote the full schedule rather than pricing one event at a time.",
    section3Title: "Who usually books this",
