    intro: "Premium Pagri Tying Service in Delhi covers exactly what we do best — professional, on-location safa and pagdi tying for weddings, baraats and every function in between.",
    section1Title: "What this covers",
    section1Body: "For larger groups, we divide guests into batches so the tying stays organised even when people arrive at different times. One coordinator keeps the queue moving without rushing anyone.",
