    category: "Expanded tying intent",
    serviceSlug: "wedding-safa-tying",
    intro: "Baraat Pagdi Tying Specialist in Delhi is one of the most common requests we get from couples and families planning a wedding, and it starts with a single detail: your date, venue and guest count.",
